And so what happens is it collects enough mass.

00:14:21.126 --> 00:14:24.396
It hits that number, that 1.4 solar masses, and collapses and explodes.

00:14:24.997 --> 00:14:30.269
And because they always blow up at 1.4 solar masses,

00:14:30.269 --> 00:14:34.240
we know exactly how bright that explosion is supposed to be. Okay.

